{"icmlt_2022__location__rome_italy": "The predicate 'location' specifies the place where the ICMLT 2022 conference was held.|Here is another description: _The location predicate specifies where the _ICMLT 2022 conference was held. This information is crucial for attendees and participants to know the physical venue of the event._"},
