{"fraudsters": "Fraudsters are individuals or groups who engage in deceptive activities to gain unauthorized access to financial resources, particularly through the misuse of credit card information.|Here is another description: Fraudsters are individuals or groups who engage in deceptive activities to gain unauthorized access to financial resources, often resulting in significant financial losses for victims and financial institutions."},
