{"transactions": "Transactions in this context refer to the financial exchanges facilitated by credit cards, which have become a prevalent method of payment. These transactions are susceptible to fraudulent activities where individuals impersonate legitimate users."},
{"transactions__cost__billions_of_dollars_every_year": "The predicate 'cost' in this triple signifies the financial burden or expense incurred due to fraudulent activities. It represents the monetary impact of credit card fraud on the economy and financial systems."},
