{"method__combines__luhn_s_algorithm_and_hunt_s_algorithm": "The predicate \"combines\" indicates that the method integrates multiple algorithms into a unified process. This integration aims to enhance the accuracy and reliability of the validation checks performed on transaction data."},
{"luhn_s_algorithm_and_hunt_s_algorithm": "Luhn\u2019s algorithm and Hunt\u2019s algorithm are specific algorithms used for validating the integrity of data, particularly in the context of financial transactions. Luhn\u2019s algorithm is commonly used to validate identification numbers like credit card numbers, while Hunt\u2019s algorithm may refer to a method for detecting anomalies or outliers in data sets."},
