{"our_model": "Our model refers to the comprehensive system designed for the task, which employs a pipeline approach for construction. It integrates machine learning and deep learning techniques to enhance data processing and prediction accuracy.|Here is another description: Our model refers to a specific machine learning or neural network architecture that has been developed and tested for a particular task, achieving a high level of performance as indicated by its metrics.|Here is another description: Our model refers to a specific machine learning or neural network architecture that has been evaluated in comparison to other models like MLP, BNN, CNN, LSTM, and AutoEncoder. It is characterized by its performance metrics.|Here is another description: Our model refers to a specific machine learning or deep learning architecture that has been developed and tested for a particular task, achieving a high accuracy rate of 99.85%.|Here is another description: Our model refers to a specific deep learning model developed for the experiment, which includes the incorporation of a transformer layer to enhance its performance."},
{"our_model__is_divided_into__two_parts": "The phrase \"is divided into\" indicates a structural separation within the model, where it is organized into distinct components to perform specific functions in the data processing and analysis pipeline."},
{"two_parts": "The two parts of the model consist of a feature filter based on a machine learning algorithm and a deep learning-based neural network. The feature filter selects important features and filters out less important ones, while the neural network optimizes and learns from the data using a Transformer structure and a binary classifier for fraud prediction."},
{"the_first_part": "The first part of the model is a component designed to process and refine the input data before it is used for training. It plays a crucial role in enhancing the model's performance by focusing on the most relevant information."},
{"the_first_part__is__a_feature_filter_based_on_a_machine_learning_algorithm": "The term \"is\" here signifies the identification or classification of the first part of the model, establishing its role and function within the overall model architecture."},
{"a_feature_filter_based_on_a_machine_learning_algorithm": "A feature filter based on a machine learning algorithm is a system that uses machine learning techniques to evaluate and select the most significant features from a dataset. This filter helps in improving the efficiency and accuracy of the subsequent model by reducing noise and focusing on relevant data points."},
{"the_feature_filter": "The feature filter is a component in the model construction pipeline that utilizes a machine learning algorithm to process input data.|Here is another description: The feature filter is a component in the model construction pipeline that utilizes a machine learning algorithm to identify and select the most significant features from the data for training purposes."},
