{"transformer_based_model": "The Transformer-based Model is a sophisticated machine learning approach that utilizes the Transformer architecture to process and analyze data. It is designed to handle sequential data effectively, making it suitable for various applications including fraud detection."},
{"transformer_based_model__is_integrated_with__feature_selection": "The integration of Feature Selection with the Transformer-based Model signifies the combination of two distinct methodologies. Feature Selection is a process used to identify and select the most relevant features from a dataset, which are then used by the Transformer-based Model to improve its performance and accuracy in tasks like credit card fraud detection."},
{"credit_card_fraud_detection__is_the_application_of__transformer_based_model_integrated_with_feature_selection": "The application of signifies the utilization or implementation of a specific method or technology to achieve a particular goal or solve a problem, in this case, enhancing the accuracy and efficiency of detecting fraudulent credit card transactions."},
