{"only_numerical_input_variables_which_are_the_result_of_a_pca_transformation": "The object describes the specific type of input variables present in the dataset: only numerical input variables which are the result of a PCA (Principal Component Analysis) transformation. These variables, denoted as V1, V2,..., V28, represent the principal components derived from the original data features through PCA, excluding the Time and Amount features which remain untransformed."},
