{"a_bi_directional_lstm_model": "The object \"a bi-directional LSTM model\" is the specific type of model that the subject has implemented. This model is a type of recurrent neural network that processes input sequences in both forward and backward directions, allowing it to capture dependencies from both past and future contexts, which can be particularly useful for sequence prediction tasks."},
