{"bayes_rule": "Bayes\u2019 rule is a fundamental theorem in probability theory that describes how to update the probability of a hypothesis as more evidence is acquired. In the context of the Bayesian-based neural network, Bayes\u2019 rule is used to adjust the weights of the network based on new data, allowing the model to continuously improve its performance."},
