{"performance_in_fraud_detection": "Performance in fraud detection refers to the effectiveness and accuracy of a model in identifying fraudulent activities within a dataset. In the context of the paper, it involves evaluating how well the neural network, particularly with Long Short-term memory components, can detect fraudulent transactions, especially in an imbalanced dataset where fraudulent transactions are rare."},
