{"four_layers": "The four layers in the neural network represent the segmented structure of the model. Each layer likely processes the input data in a sequential manner, with the output of one layer serving as the input for the next, culminating in the final feature extraction process."},
{"filtered_feature_xf": "The filtered feature xf refers to a set of features that have been selected and processed in a prior step, specifically mentioned as occurring in section 3.1. These features are deemed relevant and have undergone some form of filtering or selection process to be considered for further analysis or modeling."},
