{"transformer_model__is_a__feature_extractor_based_on_multiheaded_attention_mechanism": "\"Is a\" serves as a classification or identification predicate, indicating that the subject, the Transformer model, belongs to a specific category or has a particular characteristic. In this context, it identifies the Transformer model as a type of feature extractor."},
{"feature_extractor_based_on_multiheaded_attention_mechanism": "A feature extractor based on a multiheaded attention mechanism is a type of neural network component that identifies and emphasizes important features within input data. The multiheaded attention mechanism allows the model to attend to different positions within a sequence simultaneously, capturing complex relationships and dependencies between elements in the data."},
