{"the_weighted_representation_of_all_input_features_per_unit_of_time": "The weighted representation of all input features per unit of time is the output generated by the Transformer's self-attention mechanism. This representation emphasizes certain features over others based on their relevance, enabling the model to better capture and process sequential information."},
