{"transaction_amount": "The transaction Amount is a specific attribute or characteristic within a dataset that represents the monetary value of individual transactions. It is one of the key variables used in analyzing and understanding the patterns and behaviors within transactional data.|Here is another description: The transaction Amount is a specific financial metric representing the sum of money involved in a particular transaction. It is a crucial feature in datasets related to financial transactions, especially in the context of fraud detection."},
